{
  "name": "Monitor competitors' new Google ads weekly and alert Slack with Apify",
  "active": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "cd03d17f-19e2-4943-815e-f162d90aa275",
      "name": "Every Monday morning",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "weeks",
              "weeksInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtDay": [
                1
              ],
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e1c7a7d6-eed5-4570-b4b4-e3a845742dac",
      "name": "Configure this batch",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        290,
        420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "3ab04845-bb70-4903-b608-982790cc068f",
              "name": "country",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "US"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "024ba6a8-084f-4542-b03e-6bbaa2a583a6",
      "name": "Read competitor domains",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "position": [
        580,
        420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "read",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "YOUR_SHEET_ID"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "Competitors"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.5
    },
    {
      "id": "3c9868a4-de35-4645-bf26-b69a6c40c99b",
      "name": "Build one competitor batch",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        870,
        420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "const c = $('Configure this batch').first().json;\nconst values = [...new Set($input.all().map(i => String(i.json[\"Domain\"] ?? '').trim()).filter(Boolean))];\nif (!values.length) return [];\nif (values.length > 3) throw new Error('Batch exceeds 3 inputs; reduce the sheet before running.');\nif (values.some(v => v.includes('YOUR_'))) throw new Error('Replace input placeholders.');\n\nreturn [{json:{...c, domains:values}}];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a17c4704-325e-427a-8506-964f384cd8ec",
      "name": "Run one Apify batch",
      "type": "@apify/n8n-nodes-apify.apify",
      "position": [
        1160,
        420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "Actors",
        "operation": "Run actor and get dataset",
        "actorId": "hirepulse~google-ads-transparency-scraper",
        "customBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({domains:$json.domains,country:$json.country,mode:'ads',max_ads_per_domain:20,only_new_ads:true}) }}",
        "memory": 256,
        "maxTotalChargeUsd": 1
      },
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "retryOnFail": false
    },
    {
      "id": "a3dfb913-5674-4fab-bb43-744d7a3a7979",
      "name": "Compose new ads digest",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1450,
        420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "const rows=$input.all().map(i=>i.json).filter(d=>d.ad_id);\nif (!rows.length) return [];\nconst clean=v=>String(v??'').replace(/[<>&]/g,' ').replace(/[\\r\\n]+/g,' ');\nconst lines=rows.map(d=>[d.domain,d.advertiser_name,d.format,d.first_shown,d.transparency_url].map(clean).join(' | '));\nreturn [{json:{text:'Newly observed Google ads (bounded sample):\\n'+lines.join('\\n')}}];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c53f5ced-a116-4389-a2ad-061d4e1a9b2d",
      "name": "Send the digest to Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1740,
        420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "post",
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "YOUR_SLACK_CHANNEL"
        },
        "text": "={{ $json.text }}",
        "otherOptions": {
          "includeLinkToWorkflow": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "57e5dc08-f2af-4f9a-b66c-4d8a7bace35e",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -660,
        -80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Monitor competitors' new Google ads weekly and alert Slack with Apify\n\nRead competitor domains from a Google Sheet once a week and request only ads not returned by earlier matching runs. Send a single Slack digest of the returned ads.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the official @apify/n8n-nodes-apify package in your n8n environment and select your Apify credential in the Actor node.\n2. Select your Google Sheets and Slack credentials in their nodes; credentials are intentionally unassigned.\n3. Create Competitors with header Domain and up to 3 unique domains. Select YOUR_SHEET_ID and YOUR_SLACK_CHANNEL.\n4. Edit Configure this batch, replace resource placeholders, and confirm the workflow timezone and Monday 08:00 schedule before activation.\n\n### Cost\n$0.005 per domain + $0.0015 per ad. Apify run cap: $1.\n\n### Batch safety\nOne Actor run per batch, with maxTotalChargeUsd = 1, no retries and no polling. Empty input produces no paid run. A capped run may be partial; inspect its Apify results before repeating any work. Do not enable automatic retry or resume from a node that starts another Actor run.\nAt most 3 domains and 20 ads per domain. The first run establishes what has been seen; returned ads need not have launched this week. Keep the same account and filters for monitoring. No returned ad records means no Slack message. A run cap or result limit can leave ads unreported.",
        "width": 570,
        "height": 1050
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "62d4b3c7-bd0d-4388-921e-8b62f079a166",
      "name": "Step note 1",
